Node.js kya hai aur browser JavaScript se kaise different hai?
Node.js server-side environment hai jo V8 engine par chalta hai aur backend development ke liye use hota hai, jabke browser JavaScript sirf DOM manipulation aur client-side rendering tak limited hoti hai.

Node.js runtime, V8 engine
Node.js ek runtime environment hai jo JavaScript ko browser ke bahar chalane ki ijazat deta hai, aur Google Chrome ka V8 engine is code ko fast machine code mein compile karta hai.